sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Tailnet User
    participant Browser as Browser Client
    participant Ingress as Tailscale Serve
    participant Edge as Voice Edge / Pipecat
    participant Broker as Inference Broker
    participant Pi as Pi Voice Service

    loop While the voice UI is open
        Browser->>Ingress: GET /api/pi-context
        Ingress->>Edge: Proxy with authenticated tailnet identity
        Edge->>Broker: GET /v1/pi/context with broker capability
        Broker->>Pi: GET /v1/context over loopback
        Pi-->>Broker: Bounded tokens, window, percent, canCompact
        Broker-->>Edge: Context usage without transcript content
        Edge-->>Browser: no-store context snapshot
        Browser-->>User: Refresh context meter and compact availability
    end
    opt User requests compaction when enabled
        User->>Browser: Select Compact
        Browser->>Ingress: POST /api/pi-context/compact
        Ingress->>Edge: Proxy with authenticated tailnet identity
        Edge->>Broker: POST /v1/pi/context/compact with capability
        Broker->>Pi: POST /v1/context/compact over loopback
        Pi->>Pi: Compact the persistent native Pi session
        Pi-->>Broker: Refreshed bounded context usage
        Broker-->>Edge: Refreshed context usage
        Edge-->>Browser: no-store context snapshot
        Browser-->>User: Refresh context meter
    end
